Epic Inquisitor Reckoning	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:EpicClassFeature.Inquisitor	VISIBLE:YES	DEFINE:EpicReckoningUses|0	DESC:Standard action that provokes AoO, end all Judgments and invoke Reckoning. Melee touch inflicts penalty based on Judgment type. DC 10 + 1/2 level + Wis modifier. %1/day.|EpicReckoningUses	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH

Epic Inquisitor Epic Judgement	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:EpicClassFeature.Inquisitor	VISIBLE:YES	DESC:Select a permanent bonus to all Judgments: +10 temp HP, +2 sacred to skill checks, +2 sacred CMB/CMD, +1 sacred spell DCs, reroll 1 save, or immunity to a condition (Confused/Dazzled/Fatigue/Shaken/Sickened).	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH

